Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dapaxi & Michael,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes are no longer coming from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am shaking with my hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.39,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm long enough to continue long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to go to the. Yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.77,0:01:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for us to go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.69,0:01:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back to the digital world and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clean up the mess we made during\Nall those battles with Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one of us took an area, but Davis\Nand V-Mon didn't get much work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis has always been jealous\Nbecause T.K.'s Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can Digivolve to the champion\Nlevel and V-Mon can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Davis tried to trick\NV-Mon into Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just another one\Nof his hair-brain schemes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when they were being\Nchased by Tortamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:02:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon Digivolved for real,\Nand X-V-Mon was born.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(233,362)}When the Digivice
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx115\fscy115\pos(368,405)}is Tainted by Darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, honey, it's Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to know that Dad\Nand I are right outside your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere, so\Nwhen you wake up, we'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is he awake yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know he'll wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just needs a little more rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry he's strong\Njust like his mother
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i know i should wake up but i can't\Nit's not time yet not until i find my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heart it feels like i've lost it i keep\Nlooking for it but i just can't seem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to find it i know once i do everything\Nwill be back to the way it was like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when i was a little kid i used to\Nlearn everything from my older brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the time he\Ntaught me to blow bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At first, I couldn't do it,\Nbut he kept encouraging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, I was blowing\Nbubbles bigger than he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam was the real genius in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so proud of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here come the neighbor ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My cousin has a friend\Nthat knows someone that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,says your little Sam is\Nthe smartest boy in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get my picture taken with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.04,0:03:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have three daughters\NI'd like him to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, have you decided to be a\Nrocket scientist or a brain surgeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where can I get his autobiography?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.26,0:03:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and your husband are\Ngeniuses to have had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I get a lock of his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have him cloned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will he sing at my wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kind of comments went\Nstraight to my mom's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, all the neighbors came up to me again\Nand said, what a wonderful boy you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them even asked\Nme for an autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Ken, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.48,0:03:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad are always paying\Nmore attention to Sam than to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know they love him more\Nbecause he's smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never get either one of them to\Nnotice me as long as Sam's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Sam weren't\Naround, then I would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Sam weren't here, then\NI'd be the one they loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish Sam would just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, one night, a digivice\Ncame out of our computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.98,0:04:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured it had to be Sam's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phil, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, Kenny Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the computer blew\Na fuse or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, it might still be hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what this thing\Nis, but I'm going to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, listen to me, Kenny Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:05:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that Sam told me to\Nstay away from it, but I
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't help myself i felt\Nlike i was being drawn to it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somehow like something was\Ntelling me that it belonged
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to me i just wanted to look\Nat it what harm could that do
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, are you still in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better not be touching my stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken! Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.68,0:05:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my things ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.16,0:05:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to have respect\Nfor people's property, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you once not to go in\Nmy drawer, and you broke my trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll never be able to trust you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you've gotten hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad would be\Nlooking to blame someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be me, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam hated me I wasn't as good a person\Nas he was But that wasn't enough for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him He had to punish me because of it He\Ndidn't have to hit me I just wanted to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,play with his toy So what if I didn't\Nask for his permission at first And I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,couldn't tell mom and dad Because as far\Nas they were concerned He could do no wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wish
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would just disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam, I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just mad when I said\NI wanted you to disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how sad I made my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They loved Sam more than\Nanything in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how much the both of you\Nmiss Sam, but I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then one day, I was playing\Non Sam's old computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I found an email\Nthat was addressed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know who would be writing to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or how they would know\NI was on Sam's computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the loss of your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have been hard to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared, and yet I was\Ncompelled to keep reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was as if I'd been waiting\Nfor this letter my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your brother is in a better\Nplace than this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is finally at rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when his soul became\Nfree, yours became trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bear the burden of both\Nhis destiny and your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that your parents have lost\Ntheir hopes for their perfect child,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you will be expected to carry out the\Ndreams that Sam can no longer fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This world will become unbearable for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pressure to succeed\Nwould be too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me tell you about another\Nworld that is much more appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean by another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A world where your soul\Ncan finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where you answer to no one but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.80,0:08:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use Sam's Digivice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the first\Ntime I saw the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stood there all alone\Nin this huge, empty world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm afraid that if you can't\Nplay by my rules, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the games begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't hear anyone laughing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could ever take it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or hide it in a drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in control now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's having a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was remembering back\Nwhen Ken was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was about the same age\NSam was when we lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was right around the time I\Nfirst noticed a big change in Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He began to put all of his\Nattention into his studies. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.82,0:10:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was almost as if our\NSam had come back to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.32,0:10:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us and I was the happiest\Nmother in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never stopped to think\Nwhat effect it might have on Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's possible that's\Nthe reason he became like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Ken didn't want to study so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he wanted to\Nspend more time playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I do admit that I kind of enjoyed\Nthe idea of being the father of a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Sam? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we made the same mistake with Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might have had interests we ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.07,0:10:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have pushed him so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the attention so much that I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,realize what my son\Nreally needed the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chance to be a normal\Nkid once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but\Nwe failed as parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.38,0:11:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, please give us another chance\Nto be better parents to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wake up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't found my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still trying to\Nget back to that little
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kid that used to blow\Nbubbles on his terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd stand there for hours, blowing\Nthem bigger and bigger each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one was completely empty inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but none of them were as\Nempty inside as I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was trying to show Sam\Nthat I could blow bubbles bigger
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than he could And that I was\Nbetter at something than he was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, who was it that\Ntaught me to blow the bubbles?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who made the soapy water\Nfor me and cut the straws?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't my parents
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, it's all set to go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, great
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to do it now Uh, well,\NI'm not very good at blowing bubbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sam, there's nothing\Nin this world that you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it okay, but my technique\Nisn't quite as good as yours is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bubbles come out perfect\Nbecause you're gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blow too hard and mine pop right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.96,0:12:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.60,0:12:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam, come back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Sam won't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.16,0:12:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I am, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.86,0:12:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, don't you recognize who we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't lose my memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And until I find it, I don't know who\NI am or who anyone else is either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he not know\Nwho his own parents are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.32,0:12:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't know myself, who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:13:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry, you're safe now We'll find\Nyou the finest doctor in the world Ken,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while you were sleeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.26,0:13:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your mother and I\Nrealized That we tried to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make you more like Sam\Nwithout really knowing it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.48,0:13:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry We should have seen\Nthe son we had Instead of spending our
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time constantly looking for the son that\Nwe lost Forgive us All we're asking for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a second chance I don't know what it\Nis they want from me How can I forgive
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them when I don't understand what they\Ndid Sam is gone forever We know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't want to lose you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be your sweet self.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, just try. Just try.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is she crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.36,0:13:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm sad, I just go numb.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there's tears in my eyes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my heart closer than I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe these people and I can share the\Npain and sorrow of losing Sam together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the answer is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.38,0:13:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to figure out where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, honey, dinner's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hungry? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry I startled you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can eat whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.14,0:14:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all devastated after Sam's accident,\Nbut you were the one affected the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.78,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the Ken I used to love?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Wormmon, I know where to look now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.38,0:14:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, dear, I made you a nice cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where I have to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that this is where\NI will find my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.76,0:15:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DigiEggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hundreds of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the primary village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.92,0:15:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Primary village? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the place where all Digimon are\Nreborn and they come back as DigiEggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reborn? Wormmon too?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon never die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just get reconfigured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, which egg is Wormon's?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be any one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.28,0:15:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did his egg look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.70,0:15:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know which one of\Nthese Digi-eggs is Wormon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I don't remember\Nwho I am or where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.32,0:15:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the Digimon Emperor, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recognize you even\Nwithout your fancy clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.76,0:15:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done so many terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.48,0:15:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was responsible for Wormon If I\Nwould have realized the truth about
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Digi-World sooner Wormon would\Nstill be here with me today You don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.58,0:15:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to find Wormon's Digi-Egg because\Nyou miss him You just don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To feel guilty anymore over Crest and\Nhis destruction. After all you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're not going to welcome\Nyou back with open arms
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we had him What do\Nyou think is going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon's just going to hatch so he can\Nbe treated badly by you all over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon won't come back to me\NJust like my brother Sam didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come back to me after he left This\Nis a truth I don't want to face
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormon's not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sam's not coming back either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caused both of them to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hated my brother for\Ngetting all of the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hated Wormon because I\Nfelt he wasn't worthy of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is I wasn't worthy of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These hands have caused so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, put a textbook in\Nthem and I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But put a whip in them and\NI'm the evil Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I have allowed\Nthis to go so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I only had the chance\NI'd say sorry, Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Ken
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wyrmond, no
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for you\Nnow You can't turn back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time What's done is done\NYou've made your bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now lie in it I'd go on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can't think of any\Nmore cliches The point is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.92,0:17:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't run away from the past\NYou've caused enough damage here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.26,0:17:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you crawl back under\Nthe control spire you came out of?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.34,0:17:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't I start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that I've caused you all a\Nlot of pain as the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.82,0:17:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm truly sorry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cruel things I've done in\Nthe past won't ever leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've got to move on with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.86,0:17:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to concentrate on the good\Nthings in the past, not the evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my memories of Sam and\Nof Wormmon to make me stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't seem to remember\Nany of the good memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only the bad ones keep playing\Nin my head over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blocked out the good ones. I must force\Nmyself to remember the beginning. I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think back to the first time I used\NSam's Digivice to go to the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wormmon, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay. It'll take a lot more\Nthan him to beat me. Right, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that I'm your\NDigimon And we're partners
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.14,0:18:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gentle and kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gentle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bubbles come out perfect\Nbecause you're gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I blow too hard and might pop right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But being gentle is not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to be strong\Nas well. Otherwise, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your gentleness and kindness will become\Noverpowered by those who are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.96,0:18:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digivice that you have\Nbelongs to you and not Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Digidestined and no one\Ncan take that away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil forces will try to tell you\Notherwise, but you can't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never forget who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't. You promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.20,0:18:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I broke my promise because I did forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole life I've been\Ntrying to be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.46,0:19:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it was acting\Ntough as a Digimon Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or trying to be more like Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.70,0:19:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm going to spend the\Nrest of my life being the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind and gentle person\Nthat Worma wanted me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.32,0:19:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your Crest of Kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, please find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please find me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That digi-egg is\Ndifferent from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.16,0:19:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's glowing just like\Nthe Crest of Kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Leifmon, the baby form of Wormmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept searching for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took a little detour in getting\Nthere, but you kept your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:19:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being kind and gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for giving me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered if I was the one\Nwho was gone instead of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would warm on be the only one\Nwho would miss me no i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think so this time he might\Nnot come back at all don't
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say such things he'll be back\Ni'm sure of it huh ken where
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you been we've been so\Nworried about you now i understand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why she's crying? She missed\Nme just like I missed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on mama what did you say he
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,said mama that means he knows
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me mama i'll give you that\Nsecond chance if i can have one
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks for being such great parents
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.42,0:21:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I can finally say it Thank\Nyou, Sam For helping me find my heart
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little bit easier to\Ncreate a photo of my own Just
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little bit easier to create\Na feeling of feelings, I feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That it's a little more like\Nthis. I'm not even familiar.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the feeling of feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.76,0:21:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be afraid of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go Just
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
